/* Hookean dumbbell (Oldroyd-B) added to SDPD in GENERIC form, in 2D.
Every particle carries a connector vector Q with elastic energy
H Q^2/2. The reversible part convects Q with the discrete velocity
gradient G_i = sum_j F_ij v_ij r_ij/d_i; the irreversible part is
Brownian noise on Q with the entropy noise that conserves energy. */

n: 2$
assume(kB > 0, m > 0, H > 0, zeta > 0, T > 0, Ti > 0, Tj > 0, di > 0, dj > 0, Fij > 0)$
unit(ex):= ratsimp(expand(ex))$

/* irreversible part of one particle, x = (Q, S) */
gradef(T, S, T/C)$
gradef(E, S, T)$
q: makelist(Q[c], c, 1, n)$
dq: sqrt(2*kB*T/zeta)*makelist(w[c], c, 1, n)$
x: endcons(S, q)$
dx: endcons(-H/T*(q . dq), dq)$
nx: length(x)$
ito(ex):= block([ex: expand(ex)], sum(coeff(ex, w[c], 2), c, 1, n))$
Q2: genmatrix(lambda([r, s], ito(dx[r]*dx[s])), nx, nx)$
M: Q2/(2*kB)$
drift: makelist(sum(M[r, s]*diff(S, x[s]) + kB*diff(M[r, s], x[s]), s, 1, nx), r, 1, nx)$
relax: unit(rest(drift, -1) + H/zeta*q);
heat: unit(T*last(drift) - (H^2/zeta*(q . q)*(1 - kB/C) - n*H*kB*T/zeta));
Etot: H/2*(q . q) + E$
dE: unit(sum(diff(Etot, x[r])*drift[r], r, 1, nx)
  + 1/2*sum(sum(diff(Etot, x[r], 1, x[s], 1)*Q2[r, s], r, 1, nx), s, 1, nx));
Qeq: solve(ratsubst(q2, q . q,
  expand(2*(q . rest(drift, -1)) + sum(Q2[c, c], c, 1, n))), q2);

/* reversible part of one pair (i, j): convection of Q and the polymer force */
rij: makelist(r[c], c, 1, n)$
vij: makelist(vi[c] - vj[c], c, 1, n)$
Qi: makelist(qi[c], c, 1, n)$
Qj: makelist(qj[c], c, 1, n)$
dQi: Fij/di*vij*(rij . Qi)$
dQj: Fij/dj*vij*(rij . Qj)$
fi: -H*Fij*(Qi*(rij . Qi)/di + Qj*(rij . Qj)/dj)$
momentum: unit(fi + (-fi));
energy: unit(vij . fi + H*(Qi . dQi + Qj . dQj));
